 "defect": {
  "defect_type": "missing",
  "message": "The plain laminated elastomeric bearings are specified only by their layering (\"four internal rubber layers 8 mm thick\"). Their plan dimensions are never given. The bearing shape factor S = a*b/(2*t1*(a+b)) (JTG 3362-2018 8.7) and consequently the vertical stiffness Kv = count*a*b/(te*(1/Ee+1/Eb))*1000 and shear stiffness Kh = count*Ge*a*b/te*1000 require the bearing plan length a and width b, which the description omits. No default plan size is provided by the knowledge graph, so support.0.S/.Kv/.Kh and support.1.S/.Kv/.Kh cannot be evaluated."
 },
